{"cluster_id": "C-3434", "topic": "storage layout", "target": "architecture/storage-layout", "member_ids": ["B018-040"], "canonical_claim": "The CA CMake setup requires explicit `add_headers_and_sources` entries for `Primitives`, `Formats`, `Backend`, `Pool`, `Gc`, `Tools`, and `Parts` because the directory glob is non-recursive; gtests are discovered recursively and need no test-CMake edit.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-16-cas-source-layout-refactoring.md#L402-L430"]}
{"cluster_id": "C-3435", "topic": "storage layout", "target": "architecture/storage-layout", "member_ids": ["B019-004"], "canonical_claim": "`ContentAddressed::kMovingDirName` is the reserved constant whose value is `moving` for MOVE staging paths.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-17-cas-move-to-ca.md#L91-L108"]}
